%% Editable topology. Custom light/dark SVG and HTML layout: scripts/render-framework.mjs
flowchart TB
    App[Your application / CLI] --> Model[DecisionModel adapter]
    Model --> Assessment[Typed assessment signals]
    App --> Proposal[Independent intent and typed action]
    Assessment --> Core
    Proposal --> Core
    subgraph Core[Shared governance runtime]
      Validate[Validate and persist] --> Evaluate[Evaluate / review]
      Evaluate --> Permit[Bound authorization]
      Permit --> Reserve[Revalidate and reserve]
      Reserve --> Dispatch[Dispatch once]
      Dispatch --> Reconcile[Outcome / reconciliation]
      Reconcile --> Receipt[Signed receipt / replay]
    end
    subgraph Pack[Your registered domain pack]
      Schema[Action schema]
      Evidence[Trusted evidence resolver]
      Policy[Versioned deterministic policy]
      Executor[Idempotent executor]
    end
    Schema --> Validate
    Evidence --> Evaluate
    Policy --> Evaluate
    Dispatch --> Executor
    Executor --> Reconcile
    Core --> DB[(SQLite + linked audit)]
    Refunds[Refund reference domain] -. implements .-> Pack
    Access[Access reference domain] -. implements .-> Pack
    Deployment[Deployment reference domain] -. implements .-> Pack
    Custom[Your use case] -. implements .-> Pack
